# 6. ARCHITECTURE

Use a clean client-server architecture:

```text
React Frontend
       ↓
Axios
       ↓
REST API
       ↓
Express Backend
       ↓
Services
       ↓
MySQL Database
```

Backend architecture:

```text
Routes
   ↓
Middleware
   ↓
Controllers
   ↓
Services
   ↓
Database
```

Keep business logic out of route files whenever possible.

