# 11. HARDCOPY BOOKS

Hardcopy books represent physical copies.

Required information:

```text
Title
Author
ISBN
Category
Book Type
Description
Publisher
Publication Year
Quantity
Available Quantity
Cover Image
Location
```

For hardcopy:

```text
quantity >= 1
available_quantity >= 0
available_quantity <= quantity
```

When a hardcopy book is first created:

```text
available_quantity = quantity
```

---

# 12. SOFTCOPY MATERIALS

Softcopy materials represent downloadable digital resources.

Required information:

```text
Title
Author
Category
Book Type
Description
Cover Image
File
```

Supported initial file types:

```text
PDF
EPUB
```

For softcopy:

```text
quantity = NULL
available_quantity = NULL
```

A softcopy must have:

```text
file_url
```

Softcopy materials do not require borrowing.

