```text
Reserved
```

or:

```text
Request Pending
```

The book must not be requestable by another member while reserved.

---

# 80. IMPORTANT BUSINESS LOGIC

Implement these rules exactly.

### Rule 1

Softcopy books do not require approval.

### Rule 2

Softcopy books do not create borrowing records.

### Rule 3

Softcopy availability is not reduced.

### Rule 4

Hardcopy books require a request.

### Rule 5

A hardcopy copy becomes reserved immediately after a successful request.

### Rule 6

A member cannot create duplicate pending requests.

### Rule 7

A member cannot request a book they already actively borrow.

### Rule 8

Admin approval creates a borrowing record.

### Rule 9

Approval must not decrease availability a second time.

### Rule 10

Admin rejection restores the reserved availability.

### Rule 11

Returning a hardcopy restores availability.

### Rule 12

Only admins can approve/reject requests.

### Rule 13

Only admins can confirm returns.

### Rule 14

Backend must enforce all critical rules.

### Rule 15

Database transactions must be used for availability-changing operations.

