# 82. END-TO-END TEST

Verify this complete scenario:

### Hardcopy

```text
Member registers
      ↓
Logs in
      ↓
Finds a hardcopy
      ↓
Submits request
      ↓
Availability decreases
      ↓
Another member cannot request it
      ↓
Admin approves
      ↓
Borrowing created
      ↓
Member requests return
      ↓
Admin confirms return
      ↓
Availability increases
```

### Rejection

```text
Member requests
      ↓
Availability decreases
      ↓
Admin rejects
      ↓
Availability increases
```

### Softcopy

```text
Member logs in
      ↓
Finds Summer Bible Study Notes
      ↓
Opens material
      ↓
Downloads file
      ↓
No request
      ↓
No borrowing
      ↓
No availability change
```

---

# 83. ERROR/EDGE CASE TESTING

Handle cases such as:

```text
Two members request the last copy simultaneously
```

The database transaction must ensure only one succeeds.

Also handle:

```text
Admin approves an already rejected request
Admin rejects an already approved request
Member requests unavailable book
Member requests duplicate book
Book deleted while request exists
Invalid book ID
Invalid user ID
Missing upload
Invalid file
Database failure during transaction
```

Do not allow inconsistent database states.

---

# 84. DATABASE TRANSACTIONS

Use transactions for:

### Request creation

```text
Check availability
↓
Reserve copy
↓
Create request
↓
Commit
```

### Approval

```text
Check request
↓
Create borrowing
↓
Approve request
↓
Commit
```

### Rejection

```text
Reject request
↓
Restore availability
↓
Commit
```

### Return

```text
Confirm return
↓
Restore availability
↓
Commit
```

If anything fails:

```text
ROLLBACK
```

